<%- include('partials/header', { crumbs: [['Rules']] }) %>
<div class="mid">
  <h1>Rules</h1>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="box-head"><h2>1. Only sell what is yours</h2></div>
    <div class="box-body">
      <ul>
        <li>No stolen, hacked, phished, SIM-swapped or socially engineered accounts. No exceptions, permanent ban.</li>
        <li>No listings for names you do not currently control.</li>
        <li>No selling access to other people's accounts, sessions, cookies or login details.</li>
        <li>No services for taking over, banning or "claiming" someone else's username.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="box-head"><h2>2. Deal honestly</h2></div>
    <div class="box-body">
      <ul>
        <li>Scamming, chargebacks and pulling an account back after a sale get you banned.</li>
        <li>Describe the name accurately, including anything a buyer would want to know.</li>
        <li>Mark your listing sold or closed when it is no longer available.</li>
        <li>Feedback is for real, finished deals only. Trading or faking feedback is not allowed.</li>
        <li>Do not pretend to be staff or another member.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="box-head"><h2>3. Keep the forum usable</h2></div>
    <div class="box-body">
      <ul>
        <li>One listing per username. Use Bump (once a day) instead of reposting.</li>
        <li>Post in the right platform forum.</li>
        <li>No spam, harassment, threats, doxxing or posting anyone's private information.</li>
        <li>Never post passwords, emails or recovery codes in public.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="box-head"><h2>4. Know the risks</h2></div>
    <div class="box-body">
      <p>Most platforms do not allow username sales in their terms of service, and an account can be reclaimed or suspended by the platform. Every deal is at your own risk.</p>
      <p><%= site %> does not hold money or accounts and is not a party to any deal. Use a <a href="/staff">listed staff middleman</a> if you do not know the other member, and read <a href="/help">Help &amp; safety</a>.</p>
      <p>See something that breaks these rules? Use the Report link on the post or profile, or post in <a href="/f/scam-reports">Scam Reports</a> with proof.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
